WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.240
- So I, I heard,

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.740
is it true that you are super
passionate about learning

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.090
everything when you were
a kid about the Titanic?

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:08.210
'Cause I actually was obsessed
with the Titanic as well

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:09.350
when I was a kid.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.270
I just found, I found it fascinating,

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:12.840
like something, it was just so gigantic,

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:13.760
like the whole thing

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:14.800
and like how it played out

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.310
and like even how like people were like,

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:18.980
how could you leave someone just drowning

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:19.960
when there was room in your boat?

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:20.793
Like, you know,

00:00:20.793 --> 00:00:23.550
like all the whole thing emotionally

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.530
and just physically was so gigantic to me.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.160
Is it true that you were just
obsessed when you were a kid?

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.910
- Yes, and this was pre movie.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:32.520
There was a club at school

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.173
when I was in elementary school.

00:00:34.173 --> 00:00:35.006
- Oh my God,

00:00:35.006 --> 00:00:35.839
you were in a club!

00:00:35.839 --> 00:00:37.070
- Called The Titanic Club

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.860
and we'd just to learn
things about the Titanic

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.520
and we'd all like build a little,

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.210
too bad. I don't have that.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.520
That'd be such a great thing to have.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.790
We'd like build little Titanics.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.260
and I remember reading a book

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:53.160
that went like minute by
minute about what happened,

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:54.770
you know, during that night.

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:55.700
I mean, yeah,

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.120
I can't explain it, but yes.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.970
- What is something you think that people,

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:02.010
I mean, even me, I
wasn't a part of a club,

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:03.810
so you might know more than me, but,

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:06.640
but what is something that you
don't think people may know

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.966
that is like random about the Titanic?

00:01:08.966 --> 00:01:09.799
- Oh my God.

00:01:09.799 --> 00:01:10.632
I'll be honest,

00:01:10.632 --> 00:01:12.262
this was so long ago, like--

00:01:12.262 --> 00:01:13.512
- You're like, you're like I don't know.

00:01:13.512 --> 00:01:15.730
- The movie probably came
out when I was like 11 or 12

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:17.350
and this was pre that so.

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:18.183
- Yeah.

00:01:18.183 --> 00:01:20.480
- Well my Titanic skills they're--

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:21.313
- They're a little rough.

00:01:21.313 --> 00:01:22.950
They're not, they're not as sharpened.

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:24.020
Well the reason why I was too

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:27.170
is literally the Titanic
is what made me as a child

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:28.710
want to become a marine biologist,

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:30.040
'cause I thought it would just be so cool

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:30.873
to be in the ocean.

00:01:30.873 --> 00:01:31.880
It got me into like the ocean,

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.310
all the, you know,

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:35.490
just all the stories that are told,

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:36.980
like even laying on
the bottom of the ocean

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:37.813
that you don't know.

00:01:37.813 --> 00:01:39.490
I thought that was so interesting,

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.840
but I just thought it was
a random fact about you too

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:43.165
and I love that you were in a club.

00:01:43.165 --> 00:01:43.998
(laughing)

00:01:43.998 --> 00:01:45.218
- I was very cool.

00:01:45.218 --> 00:01:46.051
Like when I think people,

00:01:46.051 --> 00:01:48.886
when I tell people that
they're just like, excuse me.

00:01:48.886 --> 00:01:49.770
(laughing)

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:50.603
- They're like,

00:01:50.603 --> 00:01:53.440
maybe don't tell people that.
(laughing)

